-+# Reality-Checker Forensic QA Packet: KAN-407
-+
-+- Ticket ID: KAN-407 (`[SLICE-1-P2][KB-AUTH-SIMPLIFY] Phase 2: Simplify Multi-Card Auth & RBAC UI + Backend Wiring`)
