-   - Preserved and expanded 1-click AD vs OpenLDAP presets with canonical fields (`user_filter`, `subject_attribute`, `email_attribute`, `display_name_attribute`).
-5. **RBAC Policy Builder (`RbacPolicyBuilder.tsx`):**
