-+-Migrating issue tracking infrastructure between legacy platforms often introduces severe data loss: rich-text formatting degrades into corrupted markup, custom field hierarchies fracture, media attachments break into dead hyperlinks, and historical issue keys (`JIRA-101`, `PROJ-42`, `GH-89`) vanish, destroying institutional knowledge and broken permalinks across pull requests and documentation.
