-++### Studio Controls & Backend Setting Reference
-++
-++1. **Passphrase Input (`passphrase`):**
-++   Client-supplied encryption passphrase (minimum 16 characters). Used for client-side key derivation on direct downloads and for unlocking backup archives during restore. Never stored in PostgreSQL or logged.
-++
-++2. **Automated Backup Schedule (`enabled`, `interval_hours`):**
-++   Configures periodic automated snapshots. Values for `interval_hours` range from `1` to `168` hours (default `24`). Snapshots are created by the root-privileged `/run/postgresql/.kb_ops.sock` background daemon.
-++
-++3. **Retention Policy (`retention_count`):**
-++   Controls the number of automated snapshot files retained on disk (range `1` to `90`, default `7`). The snapshot purger automatically deletes older archives while preserving the newest snapshots.
