-++4. **Confirmation Overwrite (`confirm_overwrite`):**
-++   Mandatory safety string required for destructive database restores (`POST /api/v1/admin/standalone/restore`). Must be set to the exact string `"RESTORE"`. Submissions with missing or incorrect confirmation strings are rejected with HTTP 422 before any database teardown begins.
