-++5. **Tamper Verification Gate:**
-++   Prior to applying any restore, the backend executes `POST /api/v1/admin/standalone/backup/verify`. If even a single bit of ciphertext has been modified or corrupted, the GCM authentication tag verification fails and the operation halts with HTTP 422.
