--## 4. Universal Object Graph Link Auditor and Inspector Studio
--
--👍kanban models all work items, digital stickies, technical documents, sprint cycles, and modules as registered entities connected via typed `object_links`. The Link Auditor continuously detects and repairs referential anomalies.
-+| **1. PostgreSQL Engine (`postgresql_rls`)** | Latency, connection pool saturation, 82 single-head migrations, `FORCE RLS` on 100 tables | Latency < 15ms, saturation < 75%, 82/82 migrations | Latency > 50ms, pool exhausted, missing migration | Tune `DB_POOL_SIZE`, check Alembic single head, apply missing migrations |
-+| **2. Transactional Outbox (`realtime_hub_outbox`)** | Queue backlog, dispatch latency, relay loop status, PostgreSQL LISTEN/NOTIFY | Lag < 5s, relay running | Backlog > 1000 events, relay stopped | Inspect `database/outbox/relay.py` worker process and restart daemon |
-+| **3. Job Worker Pool (`job_worker_pool`)** | Active background tasks, concurrency limits, dead-letter queue (DLQ) depth | DLQ depth = 0 | DLQ depth > 0, executor stalled | Inspect failed task payloads, verify resource limits, restart worker |
-+| **4. Wasmtime Sandbox (`wasm_script_sandbox`)** | Wasmtime compiler initialization, memory consumption, execution fuel budget | Memory < 32 MiB (33,554,432 bytes), fuel active | Wasmtime compilation failure, fuel exhausted | Inspect custom field scripts for infinite loops, allocate fuel |
-+| **5. AI Agent Runtime (`agent_runtime_providers`)** | Provider availability (Ollama, OpenAI, Gemini), response latency, monthly token budget | Primary provider healthy, budget < 90% | Provider timeout, token cap exceeded | Rotate fallback provider, adjust monthly token ceiling |
-+| **6. Remote Runner Fleet (`remote_runner_fleet`)** | Connected build nodes over port 8444, mTLS heartbeat status, active task leases | >= 1 runner online, heartbeat < 30s | All runners offline, expired CSR tokens | Mint fresh enrollment token, verify network port :8444 ingress |
-+| **7. API Rate Limiter (`rate_limiter`)** | In-memory token bucket capacity, blocked requests, IP throttle health | System error rate = 0% | Memory leak in bucket map, false-positive blocks | Clear expired IP throttle buckets, adjust tier limits |
